# SHeL v1.1.2: Architecture, BC Status, Logo & Public Docs Mirror

## 📋 Summary

This release finalizes documentation, branding, and deployment infrastructure for the SHeL platform while updating business capability status to reflect completed features.

---

## 📐 Architecture & Documentation

**New hosted architecture documentation**
- Added `shel.architecture.md` with comprehensive system design at repo root
- Links use GitHub URLs pointing to `adadevoh/shel` on `main` branch for discoverability
- Renamed product design file to `shel.design.md` for clarity
- Architecture document includes business capability (BC) coverage catalog

**Public documentation mirror**
- Architecture document automatically synced to `adadevoh/releases` repository
- Mirror workflow publishes to `files/shel/shel.architecture.md` when file changes
- Enables centralized release documentation and version history

---

## ✅ Business Capability Status Updates

**Shipped & marked complete:**
- **AUTH** — OTP-based authentication with rate limiting and session management
- **WEB** — Single Page Application (SPA) with event dashboard and sharing UI  
- **SHARE** (Web API) — Event recipient management and shared event workflows

**Not yet implemented / documented:**
- **EVENTS-05** — Android event screens with local-first sync, grouped by topic
- **SYNC** — Cross-device session and event synchronization
- **NUDGE/NOTIFY/OPTOUT** — Notification delivery and recipient preferences

---

## 🎨 Branding

**New SHeL logo**
- Generated and added to `shel.web/public/` directory
- Accessible at `/logo.png` endpoint for Login/SignUp pages and Auth0 integration
- Used in preview and production deployments

---

## 🔧 Infrastructure

**Release workflow enhancements**
- Updated `mirror-releases.yml` workflow with necessary repository secrets
- Automatic architecture file publishing to releases repo on `preview` branch merges
- Improved DB persistence for local development (Docker)

---

## 🌐 Frontend Updates

**User experience improvements**
- Display username in dashboard and account menu
- Mark "Share" as shipped feature in landing page carousel
- Implement feed polling for real-time event updates
- Auth0 preview environment gate enabled

**Web app runtime**
- Rewrote web app as full Single Page Application (SPA)
- Improved session handling and route management
- Fixed session gate and authentication flows

---

## 🐛 Bug Fixes & Improvements

- Docker database persistence for consistent local development
- Token uniqueness guaranteed even within same second
- Session clock refactoring: 15-minute JWT, hard 1-hour session limit
- Central error handling middleware implementation
- Session idle timeout configurable (default 15 minutes)
- Improved UI session handling with notification service

